  "description": "Easy-peasy payments gateways package for Nepal 🇳🇵 — integrate eSewa, Khalti, and Fonepay (Dynamic QR) without jhanjhat. Just plug, pay, and chill! 💸",
  "id": "Nepal.Payments.Gateways",
