  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Simplified integration for popular Nepali payment providers\n        • eSewa\n        • Khalti\n        • Fonepay (Dynamic QR support)\n      - Easy-to-use APIs for faster payment gateway implementation\n      - 2.0.1: Fix Fonepay HMAC-SHA512 signing — dataValidation was base64-encoded,\n        but Fonepay's API requires lowercase hex, so every signed request (QR\n        generation, status check, tax refund) was being rejected with\n        \"Data Validation Failed\". eSewa's HMAC-SHA256 signing is unaffected.\n      - 2.1.0: eSewa V2 production form URL no longer doubles its path; Khalti V2 uses the\n        documented hosts (khalti.com/api/v2/, dev.khalti.com/api/v2/) and a JSON lookup body;\n        eSewa V2 callback signatures are actually verified; new PaymentManager.CheckStatusAsync\n        (eSewa status API, Khalti lookup) and an optional base-URL override. System.Text.Json\n        8.0.0 → 8.0.6 (netstandard targets) for GHSA-8g4q-xg66-9fp4 and GHSA-hh2w-p6rv-4g7w.",
